{"id":"enfin","lemma":"enfin","pos":"adv","rank":274,"glosses":["finally; in the end","at last, finally","in fact; indeed"],"ipa":"/ɑ̃.fɛ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/83/Fr-enfin.ogg/Fr-enfin.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Nous sommes enfin seuls.","en":"We're finally alone.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/230546","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"alone","l":"seul"}]},{"text":"On est enfin seuls.","en":"We're finally alone.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/230548","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"alone","l":"seul"}]},{"text":"Maintenant je suis enfin libre.","en":"I'm finally free now.","words":[{"g":"now, currently"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"free, at liberty"}]},{"text":"La semaine est enfin terminée.","en":"The week is finally over.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"week"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null]},{"text":"As-tu enfin fini tes devoirs ?","en":"Have you finished your homework yet?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to finish","l":"finir"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"homework"}]}]}